// Prerequisites of the rust/avoidable-closure check for this package (package/linter/monochromatic-lint/README.md,
// section "Prerequisite manifest"): libghostty-vt-sys compiles vendored Ghostty with zig, and the Slint renderer
// links the system font libraries. The library build reads Ghostty's source and its Zig packages from
// target/ghostty-offline, which `mise run //package/terminal/app:fetch:ghostty-offline-inputs` fetches with each
// archive's SHA-256 pinned in ghostty-offline-inputs.json, so the check downloads nothing while compiling.
{
  "executables": ["zig"],
  "pkg-config": ["fontconfig", "freetype2"],
  "libghostty-offline-inputs": true,
}
